// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`audit pack: a site with nothing to fix > is a short pack that says so, with no packages and no price 1`] = `
"# Site audit: Marlowe Bar

![Harbour Studio](https://harbour-studio.example/logo.png)

Prepared by **Harbour Studio**. Mia Okafor, hello at harbour-studio.example, 555 0142

Checked https://marlowe-bar.example/ on 10 Nov 2026.

## Summary

Gaugeline checked marlowe-bar.example on 10 Nov 2026 and found nothing to fix.

The pages it looked at are in good shape, so there is no work to propose today. Running Gaugeline again after each release (npx gaugeline marlowe-bar.example) keeps it that way.

## What this audit does not include

- Gaugeline looked at the site's public pages the way a visitor or a search engine does. It did not log in, fill in a form or change anything.
- It did not ask for private or admin paths.
- The email records (SPF and DMARC) were not read.
"
`;

exports[`audit pack: the HTML > is one file with its own styles, no script and a policy that allows nothing else 1`] = `
