<li dir="auto"><strong>Title of share-image-missing</strong> (Worth knowing)<ul><li dir="auto">share-image-missing evidence (https://marlowe-bar.example/)</li></ul></li>
</ol>
<h2 dir="auto">What we would fix, and what it costs</h2>
<h3 dir="auto">Search and sharing tidy-up</h3>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Price:</strong> $450–$700. <strong>Time:</strong> 4–6 hours.</p>
<ul>
<li dir="auto"><strong>Title of canonical-elsewhere</strong> (Fix this first). What is wrong with canonical-elsewhere. Done looks like: canonical-elsewhere is no longer reported when Gaugeline runs again.</li>
<li dir="auto"><strong>Title of share-image-missing</strong> (Worth knowing). What is wrong with share-image-missing. Done looks like: share-image-missing is no longer reported when Gaugeline runs again.</li>
