<li dir="auto"><strong>Title of alt-missing</strong> (Fix soon). What is wrong with alt-missing. Done looks like: alt-missing is no longer reported when Gaugeline runs again.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Not included:</strong></p>
