</ul>
<p dir="auto"><strong>How we would check it worked:</strong> We run Gaugeline again on marlowe-bar.example (npx gaugeline marlowe-bar.example) and confirm that “Title of viewport-missing” and “Title of alt-missing” are no longer reported.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Total for the packages above:</strong> $1,050–$1,600, 4–6 hours. “Phone and accessibility pass” has no hours, so it is left out of the hours. The other findings are not included.</p>
