exports[`audit pack: the Markdown > matches the pack made from a services file and a bar's findings (snapshot) 1`] = `
"# Site audit: Marlowe Bar

![Harbour Studio](https://harbour-studio.example/logo.png)

Prepared by **Harbour Studio**. Mia Okafor, hello at harbour-studio.example, 555 0142

Checked https://marlowe-bar.example/ on 10 Nov 2026.

## Summary

Gaugeline checked marlowe-bar.example on 10 Nov 2026 and found 5 things worth fixing: 2 to fix first, 2 to fix soon and 1 worth knowing.

### What is at risk

- Why canonical-elsewhere matters to the owner.
- Why menu-price-mismatch matters to the owner.
- Why viewport-missing matters to the owner.
- Why alt-missing matters to the owner.
- Why share-image-missing matters to the owner.

### The five to start with

1. **Title of canonical-elsewhere** (Fix this first)
   - canonical-elsewhere evidence (https://marlowe-bar.example/)
2. **Title of menu-price-mismatch** (Fix this first)
   - menu-price-mismatch evidence (https://marlowe-bar.example/)
3. **Title of viewport-missing** (Fix soon)
   - viewport-missing evidence (https://marlowe-bar.example/)
4. **Title of alt-missing** (Fix soon)
   - 3 images have no alt text (https://marlowe-bar.example/)
   - the logo has no alt text (https://marlowe-bar.example/)
5. **Title of share-image-missing** (Worth knowing)
   - share-image-missing evidence (https://marlowe-bar.example/)

## What we would fix, and what it costs

### Search and sharing tidy-up

**Price:** $450–$700. **Time:** 4–6 hours.

- **Title of canonical-elsewhere** (Fix this first). What is wrong with canonical-elsewhere. Done looks like: canonical-elsewhere is no longer reported when Gaugeline runs again.
- **Title of share-image-missing** (Worth knowing). What is wrong with share-image-missing. Done looks like: share-image-missing is no longer reported when Gaugeline runs again.

**Not included:**

- New page copy
- Paid search

**How we would check it worked:** We run Gaugeline again on marlowe-bar.example (npx gaugeline marlowe-bar.example) and confirm that “Title of canonical-elsewhere” and “Title of share-image-missing” are no longer reported.

### Phone and accessibility pass

**Price:** $600–$900.

- **Title of viewport-missing** (Fix soon). What is wrong with viewport-missing. Done looks like: viewport-missing is no longer reported when Gaugeline runs again.
- **Title of alt-missing** (Fix soon). What is wrong with alt-missing. Done looks like: alt-missing is no longer reported when Gaugeline runs again.

**Not included:**

- A redesign

**How we would check it worked:** We run Gaugeline again on marlowe-bar.example (npx gaugeline marlowe-bar.example) and confirm that “Title of viewport-missing” and “Title of alt-missing” are no longer reported.

**Total for the packages above:** $1,050–$1,600, 4–6 hours. “Phone and accessibility pass” has no hours, so it is left out of the hours. The other findings are not included.

## Other findings

No package above covers these, so they have no price here. We can quote them separately.

- **Title of menu-price-mismatch** (Fix this first). What is wrong with menu-price-mismatch. Done looks like: menu-price-mismatch is no longer reported when Gaugeline runs again.
  - menu-price-mismatch evidence (https://marlowe-bar.example/)

## What this audit does not include

- Gaugeline looked at the site's public pages the way a visitor or a search engine does. It did not log in, fill in a form or change anything.
- It did not ask for private or admin paths.
- The email records (SPF and DMARC) were not read.
"
`;
